      "comment": "JADED SMILE (1) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (16.98) at this track over 300m. One of the leading chances. RAGING STORM (6) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 1.75 lengths from the winner (17.07). Solid record here at the distance winning seven races. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Has ability and is one of the better chances. CRUSH YOUR RUSH (7) recorded a Special conditions Veteran race win two back then missed the frame last time at Bendigo, but drawn Box 7 this time where he has two wins. Can feature with the right run. TAKE HIS CASH (2) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot at big odds most recently.",
